  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-annual contribution 2026-2026 to UNOCHA&#x2019;s Central Emergency Response Fund (CERF)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Multi-annual contribution 2026-2029 to UNOCHA&#x2019;s Central Emergency Response Fund (CERF). CERF, managed by OCHA, provides rapid and flexible financing for life-saving humanitarian operations in sudden-onset and underfunded crises. By enabling timely resource allocation and coordinated action among UN agencies, CERF ensures aid reaches the most vulnerable populations efficiently.</narrative>
  </description>
